#: ui/preferencesPage.js:46
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "首选项"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:85
msgid "ChromaLeon only exists thanks to users like you!"
msgstr "ChromaLeon 项目的存续离不开像您一样的用户！"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:87
msgid ""
"If ChromaLeon has earned a place in your device's customization, consider "
"helping the project move forward by making a small donation."
msgstr ""
"如果你很喜欢用 ChromaLeon 做设备个性化，欢迎小额捐赠以支持项目继续开发。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:148
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:153
msgid "GNOME Colors"
msgstr "GNOME 强调色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:154
msgid "Use native GNOME colors instead of wallpaper colors."
msgstr "使用 GNOME 原生强调色，而非背景提取颜色。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:159
msgid "Persistent Choices"
msgstr "持久选项"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:161
