msgstr "基于「Tint my GNOME」项目"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:225
msgid "Tint Shell"
msgstr "Shell 界面着色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:226
msgid "Tints the GNOME Shell with the color of your choice."
msgstr "使用选定颜色为 GNOME Shell 界面叠加色调。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:232
msgid "Tint Dark Panel"
msgstr "暗色面板着色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:233
msgid "Also tint the panel when in dark mode."
msgstr "暗色样式下对面板叠加色调。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:245
msgid "Tint Apps"
msgstr "应用着色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:247
msgid "Tints the LibAdwaita applications with the color of your choice."
msgstr "使用选定颜色为 LibAdwaita 应用叠加色调。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:254
msgid ""
"Also tint the GTK3 apps (the {0} extension and the {1} theme are required to "
"avoid bugs)."
msgstr ""
"使用选定颜色为 GTK3 应用叠加色调（需安装 {0} 扩展与 {1} 主题以规避故障）。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:266
msgid "Tint GTK3 Apps"
msgstr "GTK3 应用着色"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:279
msgid "Subtle"
msgstr "柔和"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:280
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:281
msgid "Strong"
msgstr "浓郁"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:282
msgid "Stronger"
msgstr "浓烈"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:286
msgid "Tinting Strength"
msgstr "着色强度"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:287
msgid "Determines the strength of the tint effect."
msgstr "调节着色效果强度。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:293
msgid "Darker Tint"
msgstr "加深着色色调"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:294
msgid "Applies a darker tint."
msgstr "启用加深着色效果。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:343
msgid "Icon Theme"
msgstr "图标主题"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:348
msgid "Folder icon theme"
msgstr "文件夹图标主题"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:349
msgid "Applies the accent color to folder icons."
msgstr "将强调色应用至文件夹图标。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:355
msgid "Application icon theme"
msgstr "应用图标主题"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:356
msgid "Applies the accent color to some app icons."
msgstr "将强调色应用至部分应用图标。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:360
msgid "MoreWaita"
msgstr "MoreWaita"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:361
msgid "Applies integration with the MoreWaita icon pack."
msgstr "启用与 MoreWaita 图标包的适配集成。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:398
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "自定义"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:403
msgid "Custom stylesheet"
msgstr "自定义样式表"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:405
msgid ""
"A file that overrides the CSS of the shell and user extensions, with support "
"for ChromaLeon accent colors."
msgstr ""
"该文件可覆盖 Shell 与用户扩展的样式（CSS），支持使用 ChromaLeon 强调色变量。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:424 ui/preferencesPage.js:441
#: ui/preferencesPage.js:501
msgid "About the custom stylesheet"
msgstr "关于自定义样式表"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:430
msgid "Open file"
msgstr "打开文件"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:443
msgid ""
"This file is used to apply custom CSS to GNOME Shell.\n"
"\n"
"The extension processes all content within this file, replacing the "
"<b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</tt></b> and <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> variables "
"with the color selected in the ChromaLeon settings before applying them to "
"the system. This can be useful if an extension does not have the accent "
"colors applied correctly.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tip:</b> If your changes do not take effect, try adding <b><tt>!"
"important</tt></b> to your CSS rules."
msgstr ""
"该文件用于向 GNOME Shell 加载自定义 CSS。\n"
"\n"
"扩展会预处理文件内全部内容：在样式应用至系统前，将变量 <b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</"
"tt></b> 与 <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> 替换为你在 ChromaLeon 设置中选定"
"的强调色。该功能可修复部分扩展强调色渲染异常的问题。\n"
"\n"
"<b>提示：</b> 若修改未生效，可尝试在 CSS 规则中添加 <b><tt>!important</tt></"
"b>。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:450 ui/preferencesPage.js:519
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:472
msgid "Failed to open custom.css: "
msgstr "无法打开 custom.css 文件： "

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:481
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "杂项"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:486
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:487
msgid "Default (recommended)"
msgstr "默认（推荐）"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:488
msgid "Smooth (experimental)"
msgstr "平滑（实验性）"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:492
msgid "Hot Reload"
msgstr "热重载"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:493
msgid "Enables theme hot reloading for GTK4 applications."
msgstr "为 GTK4 应用启用主题热重载。"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:509
msgid "About Hot Reload"
msgstr "关于热重载"

#: ui/preferencesPage.js:511
msgid ""
"Hot reload uses rapid switching between the high contrast theme and the "
"default theme to force GTK4 applications to reload the stylesheet.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Default reload:</b> This is the recommended, native option. While it may "
"cause flickering during the switch in some cases, it is the safest option "
"and the one least prone to issues during the transition.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Smooth reload:</b> This option uses a subprocess to speed up execution, "
"drastically reducing flickering when switching themes. However, it is the "
"least reliable option, as it can lead to errors such as failed reloads or "
"getting stuck on the high contrast theme (or vice versa, if you use GNOME "
"with that style enabled).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Note:</b> This does not apply to native GNOME accent colors, as it is not "
"necessary for them."
msgstr ""
"热重载通过在高对比度主题与默认主题之间快速切换，强制 GTK4 应用重新加载样式"
"表。\n"
"\n"
"<b>默认重载：</b> 推荐使用的原生方案。部分场景切换时可能出现闪烁，但最为稳"
"定，切换过程不易产生异常。\n"
"\n"
"<b>平滑重载：</b> 该模式借助子进程提升执行效率，大幅减轻主题切换时的闪烁现"
"象。可靠性欠佳，可能出现重载失败、界面卡在高对比度主题等问题（若 GNOME 已启用"
"高对比度样式，则可能反向卡住）。\n"
"\n"
"<b>注意：</b> 该功能不适用于 GNOME 原生强调色，原生强调色无需此机制。"

